; Commodore 64 runtime — the system half of MOS6502C64Target.GetRuntime(), appended to
; runtime.irie. Functions here back [MethodImpl(InternalCall)] methods of the C64 CoreLib.

; @HeapStart : () -> ptr — where the managed heap begins: the first byte after the
; program image (code, data and zero-initialised globals), which the binary encoder
; defines as @__image_end. Backs ManagedHeap.HeapStart (ManagedHeap.C64.cs).
func @HeapStart : () -> ptr {
bb0():
    %0 : ptr = mem.symbol @__image_end
    core.return %0
}
